      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 2,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "哎呀！<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳是上次那位！\n現在我在拍攝電影的另一個橋段。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŰ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 336,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "54CE5440FF0100100003110000FF01014F6059B3662F4E0A6B2190A34F4DFF01000A73FE57286211572862CD651D96FB5F71768453E64E00500B6A4B6BB5300200100002011401700000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 37
    },
    {
      "displayText": "這次是恐怖主題！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŰ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 412,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "90196B21662F605060164E3B984CFF0100100002011401700000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 13
    },
    {
      "displayText": "這次要拍的是朽木妖這種寶可夢，\n牠被當作森林裡的怪物而受人畏懼！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŰ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 440,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "90196B21898162CD7684662F673D6728599690197A2E5BF653EF5922FF0C000A726088AB75764F5C68EE679788E17684602A7269800C53D74EBA754F61FCFF0100100002011401700000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 37
    },
    {
      "displayText": "但是野生寶可夢很可怕！\n幽靈屬性更是不用說！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŰ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 516,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F46662F91CE751F5BF653EF59225F8853EF6015FF01000A5E7D97485C6C602766F4662F4E0D75288AAAFF0100100002011401700000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "所以這次一樣要請<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳出馬。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŰ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 572,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62404EE590196B214E006A2389818ACB00100003110000FF01014F6059B351FA99AC300200100002011401700000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "野生的朽木妖\n似乎非常地稀有。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŰ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 620,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "91CE751F7684673D67285996000A4F3C4E4E975E5E3857307A006709300200100002011401700000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 20
    },
    {
      "displayText": "雖然有聽說過牠會出現在\n13號還是15號野生特區……<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŰ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 660,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "96D671366709807D8AAA904E7260670351FA73FE5728000A00310033865F9084662F00310035865F91CE751F727953402026202600100002011401700000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "不過就算是從小木靈進化來的\n朽木妖也沒差就是了！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŰ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 724,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E0D904E5C317B97662F5F9E5C0F67289748903253164F867684000A673D672859964E5F6C925DEE5C31662F4E86FF0100100002011401700000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "總之能拜託<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳在晚上的時候\n帶朽木妖過來嗎？<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŰ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 784,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "7E3D4E4B80FD62DC8A1700100003110000FF01014F6059B35728665A4E0A768466425019000A5E36673D67285996904E4F8655CEFF1F00100002011401700000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 32
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿\n",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 848,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳願意幫忙拍攝嗎？<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n那就拜託<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳在晚上的時候\n將朽木妖加入到同行隊伍裡再帶過來吧！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŰ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 8,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 860,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100003110000FF01014F6059B39858610F5E6B5FD962CD651D55CEFF1F00100001BE01000A90A35C3162DC8A1700100003110000FF01014F6059B35728665A4E0A768466425019000A5C07673D6728599652A051655230540C884C968A4F0D88E1518D5E36904E4F865427FF0100100002011401700000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 60
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳帶著朽木妖啊！\n也就是說<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳願意幫忙拍攝對吧。<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n拍攝時間是晚上！晚上再過來吧！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŰ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 8,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 980,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100003110000FF01014F6059B35E368457673D67285996554AFF01000A4E5F5C31662F8AAA00100003110000FF01014F6059B39858610F5E6B5FD962CD651D5C0D5427300200100001BE00000A62CD651D66429593662F665A4E0AFF01665A4E0A518D904E4F865427FF0100100002011401700000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 59
    },
    {
      "displayText": "拍攝又暫停了嗎？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƕ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 1100,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62CD651D53C866AB505C4E8655CEFF1F00100002011401950000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 13
    },
    {
      "displayText": "恐怖場景……\n好緊張啊……<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƖ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 1128,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "605060165834666F20262026000A597D7DCA5F35554A2026202600100002011401960000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 18
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+000F>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 1164,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "難道<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳是要讓<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳的朽木妖\n來幫忙拍攝嗎？<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŰ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 1176,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "96E3905300100003110000FF01014F6059B3662F89818B9300100003110000FF01014F6059B37684673D67285996000A4F865E6B5FD962CD651D55CEFF1F00100002011401700000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 36
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我要幫忙！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 1248,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "621189815E6B5FD9FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "還是算了",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 1260,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "9084662F7B974E860000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我想要寶可夢特有的\n那種震撼力啊……！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŰ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 1272,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "621160F389815BF653EF5922727967097684000A90A37A2E970764BC529B554A20262026FF0100100002011401700000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "不愧是<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳！\n好，開始拍攝吧！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŰ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 1320,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E0D6127662F00100003110000FF01014F6059B3FF01000A597DFF0C958B59CB62CD651D5427FF0100100002011401700000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "準備好了嗎！？\n預備……Action！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŰ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 1372,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6E965099597D4E8655CEFF01FF1F000A98105099202620260041006300740069006F006EFF0100100002011401700000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "這裡……會不會出現幽靈什麼的？<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƖ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 1420,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "901988E12026202667034E0D670351FA73FE5E7D97484EC09EBC7684FF1F00100002011401960000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 20
    },
    {
      "displayText": "不用擔心啦！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƕ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 1460,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E0D752864D45FC35566FF0100100002011401950000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 11
    },
    {
      "displayText": "等等……\n是不是有什麼聲音？<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƖ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 1484,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "7B497B4920262026000A662F4E0D662F67094EC09EBC807297F3FF1F00100002011401960000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 19
    },
    {
      "displayText": "有嗎？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƕ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 1524,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "670955CEFF1F00100002011401950000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 8
    },
    {
      "displayText": "呵呵嘿……！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 1540,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "54755475563F20262026FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 7
    },
    {
      "displayText": "呀啊啊啊！！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƖ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 1556,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5440554A554A554AFF01FF0100100002011401960000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 11
    },
    {
      "displayText": "……嗯？\n一點都不可怕耶。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƖ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 28,
      "offsetInSection": 1580,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "2026202655EFFF1F000A4E009EDE90FD4E0D53EF60158036300200100002011401960000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 18
    },
    {
      "displayText": "卡～！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŰ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 29,
      "offsetInSection": 1616,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5361FF5EFF0100100002011401700000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 8
    },
    {
      "displayText": "最好是會有\n這麼友善的森林怪物啦！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŰ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 30,
      "offsetInSection": 1632,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6700597D662F67036709000A90199EBC53CB5584768468EE6797602A72695566FF0100100002011401700000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    },
    {
      "displayText": "話說回來聽說朽木妖\n對住在森林裡的生物們都很友善喔。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƕ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 31,
      "offsetInSection": 1676,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8A718AAA56DE4F86807D8AAA673D67285996000A5C0D4F4F572868EE679788E17684751F7269501190FD5F8853CB55845594300200100002011401950000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我們……難道是\n被牠認定成森林的好夥伴了嗎？<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƖ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 32,
      "offsetInSection": 1740,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "621150112026202696E39053662F000A88AB72608A8D5B9A621068EE67977684597D59254F344E8655CEFF1F00100002011401960000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "什麼！？竟然是只會展現給夥伴的\n幽靈屬性寶可夢的柔情……<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŰ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 33,
      "offsetInSection": 1796,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4EC09EBCFF01FF1F7ADF7136662F53EA67035C5573FE7D6659254F347684000A5E7D97485C6C60275BF653EF5922768467D460C52026202600100002011401700000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 33
    },
    {
      "displayText": "這也是寶可夢的真實樣貌！\n是應該用電影保存下來的畫面！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŰ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 34,
      "offsetInSection": 1864,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "90194E5F662F5BF653EF59227684771F5BE66A238C8CFF01000A662F61C98A72752896FB5F714FDD5B584E0B4F867684756B9762FF0100100002011401700000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 32
    },
    {
      "displayText": "畫面是很重要的！\n不需要說明也能打動任何人的畫面！<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n為此即使要改變故事也在所不惜！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŰ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 35,
      "offsetInSection": 1928,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "756B9762662F5F8891CD89817684FF01000A4E0D970089818AAA660E4E5F80FD625352D54EFB4F554EBA7684756B9762FF0100100001BE00000A70BA6B6453734F7F898165398B8A65454E8B4E5F572862404E0D60DCFF0100100002011401700000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 49
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿$",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 36,
      "offsetInSection": 2028,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00240000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "這世界上只有我……\n才知道朽木妖的真實樣貌與深淵！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŰ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 37,
      "offsetInSection": 2040,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "90194E16754C4E0A53EA6709621120262026000A624D77E59053673D672859967684771F5BE66A238C8C82076DF16DF5FF0100100002011401700000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "劇本是電影的設計圖，\n為了畫面修改故事這樣好嗎？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƕ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 38,
      "offsetInSection": 2100,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5287672C662F96FB5F7176848A2D8A085716FF0C000A70BA4E86756B97624FEE653965454E8B90196A23597D55CEFF1F00100002011401950000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "仔細看看朽木妖，\n就會發現牠的眼神很溫柔呢。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƖ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 39,
      "offsetInSection": 2160,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4ED47D30770B770B673D67285996FF0C000A5C316703767C73FE72607684773C795E5F886EAB67D45462300200100002011401960000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    }
